    (Next Month + Avg $/kWh + Trend) stat row over the bar chart.
  - Data: shared useVehicles (default = first vehicle id) + useCostForecast (GET /analytics/cost-forecast?
    vehicle_id=&months=6, declared in useCharging.ts) decoded from raw JSON {historical[],forecast[]};
    currency symbol from /settings (useFormatting).
  - buildChartData parity: every historical month (isForecast=false) then every forecast month
    (isForecast=true), `.slice(-6)` trailing window; bars render in the web indigo #6366f1.
  - Stats parity: Next Month = formatCurrency(forecast[0].cost, 0); Avg $/kWh = formatCurrency(last
    historical.cost_per_kwh, 2) or em-dash when no historical; Trend = (nextCost>=lastCost) ? "↑ Δ" : "↓ Δ"
    (compact: arrow only). trendUp drives the header TrendingUp(amber #FBBF24)/TrendingDown(emerald #34D399).
  - Y-axis formatter = currencySymbol + integer (web `${currencySymbol}${fmt(v,0)}`); currency/number
    formatting reproduces web useFormatting formatCurrency via shared ChartFormat.number (locale grouping).
  - Registry: id "cost-forecast", category "charging", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40 (CostForecastRegistration).
  - i18n: translation_widget_costForecast_{title,noData,nextMonth,trend,avgPerKwh,costLabel} (all already
